{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1061588/block/singleImage/3255576/df/1488423599_JY.jpg?updatedAt=1793609773\"/><figcaption>中國人民銀行。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>財聯社報道，中國人民銀行、證監會與多家券商、基金公司今日(2日)上午進行座談會。會上消息透露，中國人民銀行將於明天啟動第3次證券、基金、保險公司互換便利操作招標。此次機構申報意願積極，有超30家機構申報。 與會者表示，互換便利操作是支持資本市場的有益探索，此次座談會再次吹響集結號，券商、基金等機構將積極主動用好互換便利工具，申報成功後盡快將增量資金投向資本市場。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T09:41:23.180963+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":196,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T08:56:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T09:58:29.891278+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T09:38:33.565161+00:00","content_hash":"faa22b264c0c7b1745a00acaeba7ea7162f8521840fdc1f462b51b54c6c89b0e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T09:41:23.180963+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}